    "index.x1": "The Arteast Agency is the first digital marketing agency in Spain specialized in the Chinese market. We offer social media, SEO, SEM, consulting services and more to help you grow in the Chinese market.",
    "index.x2": "digital marketing, Chinese market, SEO, SEM, social media, consulting, international expansion, \n      The Arteast Agency, The Art East Agency, creativity, strategic marketing, Spain and China",
