    "index.t9": "The first digital marketing agency in Spain specialized in the Chinese market. We help Spanish companies grow in the Chinese market.",
    "index.t10": "Presence in China",
    "index.t11": "We help you expand with creativity and innovation in the Chinese market and seize new business and growth opportunities.",
    "index.t12": "Increase Sales",
    "index.t13": "Trust us to make the leap into China, increase your presence in other markets, and boost your sales.",
    "index.t14": "Get to Know Us",
    "index.t15": "ABOUT US",
    "index.t16": "We are the first digital marketing agency in Spain specialized in the Chinese market. We are dedicated to designing digital strategies that facilitate your brand's entry and growth in this dynamic market. We combine strategic creativity with deep cultural knowledge, helping you boost your brand and connect authentically and effectively with your Chinese audience.",
    "index.t17": "Innovative Approach",
    "index.t18": "We design original solutions that stand out and add value, creating impactful strategies that set you apart.",
    "index.t19": "Customer Engagement",
    "index.t20": "We foster trust and communication, supporting you with a friendly and personalized approach to achieve your objectives.",
    "index.t21": "Multicultural Experts",
    "index.t22": "With roots in Spain and China, we integrate language and culture to succeed in this market, adapting strategies to each audience.",
    "index.t23": "More About Us",
    "index.t24": "China is one of the most dynamic and fastest-growing markets, with over 1.4 billion consumers and a unique digital ecosystem. Its young and connected population offers great opportunities for brands that wish to expand. Platforms such as WeChat, Weibo, and RedNote allow a direct and effective connection with users. Whether you want to attract Chinese tourists, connect with the local Chinese community, or establish your brand in this market, China is a safe bet for the future of global commerce.",
    "index.t25": "Our Services",
    "index.t26": "We provide comprehensive strategy and marketing solutions to boost your brand in the digital market in China.",
    "index.t27": "Social Media Management",
    "index.t28": "We manage your social media, ensuring to respond to messages and reviews in alignment with your brand. We evaluate results and propose improvements to strengthen your connection with the audience.",
    "index.t29": "Content Creation",
    "index.t30": "We produce high-quality visual and audiovisual content, tailored to your brand's objectives and values. Our creative team designs each piece with precision, ensuring a relevant and attractive impact for your audience.",
    "index.t31": "Digital Consulting in China",
    "index.t32": "We facilitate your entry into the Chinese digital market with specialized consulting. We leverage our cultural and key platform knowledge to help you understand and stand out in this competitive environment.",
    "index.t33": "Brand Representation",
    "index.t34": "We support your expansion into the Chinese market with strategies that include e-commerce and local partnerships. We work to position your brand and connect with consumers, ensuring solid and sustainable growth.",
    "index.t35": "Influencer Management",
    "index.t36": "We represent influencers and manage strategic collaborations in China. We take care of maximizing their digital presence and facilitating connections with local brands to boost their impact.",
    "index.t37": "SEO and SEM",
    "index.t38": "We optimize your visibility on Chinese search engines with advanced SEO and SEM strategies. We continuously design and adjust campaigns to attract qualified traffic and maximize your results in this market.",
    "index.t39": "I Want to Know More",
    "index.t40": "Want to know more?",
    "index.t41": "Get to know our agency in this video",
    "index.t42": "Social Media in China",
    "index.t43": "Discover some of the key platforms that thrive in the Chinese digital market.",
    "index.t44": "小红书, or RedNote, combines the best of social media and e-commerce. Popular among Generation Z, it allows users to share reviews, discover products, and make purchases within the same app. Its focus on authentic, user-generated content gives it credibility, making it an ideal tool for brands seeking trust. Additionally, its ability to highlight attractive content enables companies to build strong relationships with young consumers, naturally and effectively promoting products.",
    "index.t45": "微信, or WeChat, is a multifunctional platform that goes beyond traditional messaging. With over 1.3 billion users, it combines social media, e-commerce, and digital payments such as WeChat Pay. Through mini-programs, promotional campaigns, and interactive posts, it provides a personalized experience. It is also crucial for customer loyalty, as it integrates tools to manage communities, conduct surveys, and offer customer service, maximizing impact and direct connection with your audience in this unique ecosystem.",
    "index.t46": "微博, known as the \"Chinese Twitter\", is essential for advertising and viral trends. It allows brands to create impactful campaigns with great reach, thanks to its visibility and amplification features. Additionally, its connection with influencers and celebrities reinforces the promotion of products or services. The analysis and segmentation tools enable companies to identify key audiences, measure results, and adjust strategies, ensuring a significant and sustainable presence in the competitive Chinese digital market.",
    "index.t47": "More Information",
    "index.t48": "Ready to conquer the Chinese market?",
    "index.t49": "From social media management to brand representation. Let's go for it!",
    "index.t50": "Let's Talk",
    "index.t51": "MORE THAN MARKETING.",
    "index.t52": "YOUR STRATEGIC PARTNER.",
    "index.t53": "We guide you every step of the way, offering our cultural and linguistic support. We aim to simplify your processes and lead your brand to success.",
    "index.t54": "Strategy and Analysis",
    "index.t55": "We create plans based on clear and measurable objectives so you can track your brand's progress in the Chinese market. We analyze emerging trends to adjust the plan to real-time needs.",
    "index.t56": "Comprehensive Implementation",
    "index.t57": "We manage your social media, create content, manage your e-commerce, and support you on any other channel necessary for your business promotion, thus increasing your brand exposure and positioning.",
    "index.t58": "Constant Updates",
    "index.t59": "Always flexible to digital updates and attentive to the latest trends, we keep you informed of changes in our weekly or monthly meetings so you can keep pace with the extraordinarily dynamic Chinese market.",
    "index.x60": "Cover",
    "index.t61": "GLOBAL VISION",
    "index.t62": "We help you enter this market, whether you have a local business seeking to attract Chinese tourists or you want to expand your brand and establish yourself directly in the Chinese market. From strategies to capture the attention of international visitors to complete solutions for entering China's digital ecosystem, our team is ready to take your business to the next level, connecting you effectively with this key audience.",
    "index.t63": "I Want to Know More",
    "index.t64": "Why Us?",
    "index.t65": "All our strategies are designed by our team in a personalized and tailored manner to your brand's needs. We measure the results to ensure sustainable growth. We are a young, highly creative team, unbound by traditional conventions and with a fresh perspective to tackle exceptional situations. We offer close and direct communication, always at the forefront of digital trends. Our goal is to accompany you in the long term and be your trusted partner.",
