    "about.t0": "The Arteast Agency, About Us",
    "about.x1": "The Arteast Agency is an innovative digital marketing agency that connects Spain and China. Specialists in social media, Chinese market consulting, e-commerce and more.",
    "about.x2": "digital marketing, Chinese market, SEO, SEM, social media, consulting, e-commerce, The Arteast Agency, The Art East Agency, creativity, innovation",
