    "about.t9": "Meet The Arteast Agency",
    "about.t10": "Innovation and creativity to connect markets between Spain and China",
    "about.t11": "We are a young agency with extensive experience in digital marketing, honed during our time at major companies. Tired of a monotonous work style, we chose to create our own brand—a brand with a more innovative, creative, fun, and most importantly, client-focused spirit. We believe in the importance of a strong and lasting relationship through effective communication, without forgetting the expertise this profession requires.",
    "about.t12": "Additionally, we possess deep knowledge of the Chinese market and social media, thanks to our roots and a genuine understanding of the country from our long stay in the Far East. Combined with our native language proficiency, which is vital for effective communication, we are confident that our professional relationship will be the beginning of many successes.",
    "about.t13": "Leave your project in our hands and rest assured.",
    "about.t14": "Why Choose Us?",
    "about.t15": "EXPONENTIAL CONTRIBUTION, 100% CUSTOMIZED APPROACH",
    "about.t16": "We understand that every business is unique. That’s why we design completely personalized digital marketing strategies, aligned with your specific objectives and target audience.",
    "about.t17": "We don’t believe in generic solutions; that’s why we offer multiple collaboration options, from basic services to comprehensive packages, fitting every budget.",
    "about.t18": "Not only do we execute campaigns, but we also measure and optimize them in real time. Through detailed analysis and KPIs, we ensure that each strategy is continuously improved, adapting to market changes and delivering the best performance.",
    "about.t19": "We work hand in hand with our clients at every stage of the process. We design, execute, and maintain open and constant communication so that you’re informed every step of the way.",
    "about.t20": "In the world of digital marketing, innovation is key. We stay up to date with the latest trends, tools, and techniques to ensure that your brand is always one step ahead of the competition.",
    "about.t21": "Our goal is not only to achieve immediate results, but also to build a solid long-term relationship. We want to be your strategic partner in your growth, accompanying you in every step of your digital evolution.",
    "about.t22": "\"Your success is our mission. We are your strategic partner to grow in the Chinese digital market.\"",
    "about.t23": "Constant Innovation",
    "about.t24": "At The Arteast Agency, innovation is key. We stay at the forefront of the latest trends and tools to ensure that your brand is always one step ahead in such a competitive market.",
    "about.t25": "I Want to Know More",
    "about.t26": "Contact",
    "about.t27": "Do you have questions or need more information? Tell us about your project and we will help you grow in the Chinese market!",
