    "about-us.t9": "Meet The Arteast Agency",
    "about-us.t10": "Innovation and creativity to connect markets between Spain and China",
    "about-us.t11": "Palma de Mallorca, JAN 29 2025",
    "about-us.t12": "We are a young agency with extensive experience in digital marketing from our time in large companies. Tired of a monotonous work style, we decided to create our own brand with a more innovative, creative, fun, and above all, client-focused spirit. We believe in the importance of a strong and lasting relationship through effective communication, without forgetting the expertise required in this profession.",
    "about-us.t13": "Additionally, we possess deep knowledge of the market and Chinese social networks, thanks to our roots and a genuine understanding of the country from our long stay in the Far East. Coupled with our native language proficiency—which is essential for effective communication—we are confident that our professional relationship will be the start of many successes.",
    "about-us.t14": "Leave your project in our hands and rest assured.",
    "about-us.t15": "Our Services",
    "about-us.t16": "1. Social Media Management",
    "about-us.t17": "We manage your digital community by responding to comments, messages, and reviews in line with your brand values and the local market. We offer a personalized service with monthly meetings to analyze results and optimize strategies.",
    "about-us.t18": "2. Content Creation",
    "about-us.t19": "We design and develop visual and audiovisual content tailored to your company. Our creative team produces attractive posts. This service is available on a one-off or daily basis.",
    "about-us.t20": "3. Digital Marketing Consulting",
    "about-us.t21": "If the Chinese market seems complex, we offer specialized consulting to help you understand its digital platforms and communication strategies. We also advise on non-digital aspects.",
    "about-us.t22": "4. Brand Representation (e-commerce)",
    "about-us.t23": "We help you expand your brand in China with a phased strategy to position you in the market and eventually open your own store or e-commerce site with a trusted local partner.",
    "about-us.t24": "5. Comprehensive Influencer Management",
    "about-us.t25": "If you are an influencer or artist looking to stand out in China, we manage your digital presence, handle brand negotiations, and explore expansion opportunities in a market of over 500 million users.",
    "about-us.t26": "Why Choose Us?",
    "about-us.t27": "EXPONENTIAL CONTRIBUTION, 100% CUSTOMIZED APPROACH",
    "about-us.t28": "We understand that every business is unique. That’s why we design completely personalized digital marketing strategies aligned with your specific objectives and the profile of your target audience.",
    "about-us.t29": "We do not believe in generic solutions; that’s why we offer multiple collaboration options—from the most basic service to a comprehensive package—tailored to all budgets.",
    "about-us.t30": "Not only do we execute campaigns, but we also measure and optimize them in real time. Through detailed analyses and KPIs, we ensure that each strategy is continuously improved, adapting to market changes and delivering optimal performance.",
    "about-us.t31": "We work closely with our clients at every stage of the process. We not only design and execute, but also maintain open and constant communication to keep you informed every step of the way.",
    "about-us.t32": "In the world of digital marketing, innovation is key. We always stay up to date with the latest trends, tools, and techniques to ensure your brand remains one step ahead of the competition.",
    "about-us.t33": "Our goal is not only to achieve immediate results, but also to build a solid long-term relationship. We want to be your strategic partner in your growth, accompanying you every step of your digital evolution.",
    "about-us.t34": "\"Your success is our mission. We are your strategic partner to grow in the Chinese digital market.\"",
    "about-us.t35": "Constant Innovation",
    "about-us.t36": "At The Arteast Agency, innovation is key. We stay at the forefront of the latest trends and tools to ensure your brand is always one step ahead in such a competitive market.",
    "chinese-social-media.x0": "The Arteast Agency is an innovative digital marketing agency that connects Spain and China. Specialists in social media, Chinese market consulting, e-commerce and more.",
    "chinese-social-media.x1": "digital marketing, Chinese market, SEO, SEM, social media, consulting, e-commerce, The Arteast Agency, creativity, innovation",
